				"_note": "CONFIG/rule record (the cancellation policy that governs notice periods, reschedule windows and fees for a bookable service). The body is the rule definition — minimum notice, reschedule window, no-show fee, card-hold requirement, refund method and the service it is linked to. It is a policy, not an appointment: no calendar or email leaf is declared or appropriate here. The audit trail sidebar records fee/notice changes, which is what a customer disputes later.",
